### Diagnosis
- **Code is correct** — reviewed `compute_pitch_amp_anchor`, training loop targets, evaluation denormalization, device handling. No bugs found.
- **Failure is conceptual**: Unlike f0 (where MIDI pitch is a precise physical anchor — cent offset < 50 cents), amplitude has no such relationship to pitch. Same pitch can have wildly different amplitudes depending on musical context. The pitch-to-average-amp lookup table is too noisy to serve as a useful anchor.

### Critical Finding: exp029 Never Evaluated
